WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Store several values together
A list is an ordered collection. Use square brackets and separate the items with commas.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Positions start at zero
Use an index in square brackets to access an item. Index 0 is the first item; index 1 is the second.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Add an item
The append() method adds a single item at the end. The len() function counts how many items are in the list.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Ready to practice?
Exercise 2 asks you to select list items and append a skill. Review zero-based indexing and length for the exam.
